  "Id": 2801,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC Signs MoU with IBEI",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "MoU between AKU-ISMC and IBEI to develop academic and cultural exchange.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC) and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Institut Barcelona d'Estudis Internacionals (IBEI)",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.ibei.org/en",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " signed today a Memorandum of Understanding."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The MoU, commencing on 01 February 2022 and finishing 01 February 2025, promotes and encourages cooperative relations between AKU-ISMC and IBEI and seeks to develop academic and cultural exchange along the lines of higher education, research, and public outreach in a mutually beneficial association. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The agreement includes joint summer and/or winter programmes, research projects, and curriculum innovation and teaching projects. It also covers exchange of publications, faculty as well as students and extends to offering IBEI students internship opportunities and discounted entry to AKU-ISMC short-courses and summer programmes, subject to availability. This is in addition to organising joint cultural programmes and outreach activities, including conferences."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The academic representatives for this cooperation Professor Leif Stenberg, AKU-ISMC's Dean, and Professor Jacint Jordana, IBEI' Director, marked this new agreement with the presence of other faculty and staff members from both institutions."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
